### H6: Negative c0 and c2 cancel the c1 turn

WHEN c1 is held at -0.8, c0 and c2 are held at -0.7, and c3 and c4 are 0 for the whole trial, THE system SHALL end with heading within 12 degrees of 0 and x above 0.1 m.

```prediction
# relies on: E1, E3, E4, E5
[[prediction]]
id = "P1"
measurement = "heading"
range = [-12, 12]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
a0 = -0.7
a1 = -0.8
a2 = -0.7
a3 = 0
a4 = 0

[[prediction]]
id = "P2"
measurement = "x"
range = [0.1, 0.3]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
a0 = -0.7
a1 = -0.8
a2 = -0.7
a3 = 0
a4 = 0
```
